      "coptic": "ⲉⲡⲉⲓⲇⲏ ⲡⲉ**ⲑⲁⲃ** ⲙⲡⲟⲩⲱϣⲙ ⲡⲉ ·",
      "english": "though surely He was the leaven of the bread.",
      "source": "Proclus Homily 23 On the Nativity in Budge ed.",
      "urn": "urn:cts:copticLit:proclus.homily23.budge",
      "dialect": "sahidic"
